{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221510","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221510","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322151001:1":{"text":"맥심 수도사님, 이제 이곳의 책임자로 승진하신 건가요?","source_cn":"马克西姆修士，看来你升职成为这里的负责人了，对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D61ABE841CA7BC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322151002:1":{"text":"아... 네. 제가 어디까지 할 수 있을지 모르겠어요. 제가 테미히아 님의 기대를 저버리지 않기만을 바라요.","source_cn":"啊……是的。真不知道我能做到什么程度，我只希望自己不要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE57FD13AF9659C6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1322151002":{"text":"아... 네. 제가 어디까지 할 수 있을지 모르겠어요. 제가 테미히아 님의 기대를 저버리지 않기만을 바라요.","source_cn":"啊……是的。真不知道我能做到什么程度，我只希望自己不要辜负特弥希娅大人的期待……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE57FD13AF9659C6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322151003:1":{"text":"축복해주셔서 감사합니다!","source_cn":"谢谢你们的祝福！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52BC61CCA29AF4C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322151004:1":{"text":"아, 만약에... 정말 만약이지만 말입니다. 또 살아있는 시체를 정화해야 할 일이 생기면 도와주실 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"对了……如果，呃，我是说如果，还有活死人需要净化的话，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE51599760CB67339","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322151005:1":{"text":"아니, 아니다. 항상 여러분께 의지할 수는 없지요. 성스러운 빛의 힘을 더 열심히 익혀야 제 소임을 다할 수 있을 거예요.","source_cn":"不对不对，我不能总想着依靠你们，我得更加努力研修圣光之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x815EDC98F805D83A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322151006:1":{"text":"여러분, 지금까지 도와주셔서 감사합니다. 듀라 여신님의 축복이 함께하시기를!","source_cn":"各位朋友，谢谢你们这段时间的帮助，愿艾雅保佑你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB27881B034938D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"잘 할 거야","source_cn":"你会做得很好的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD34EFFD1000329CB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"잘 할 거야","female":"잘 할 거야","variant_male_record_index":"69994","variant_female_record_index":"69995","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"힘 내!","source_cn":"加油！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x67EFE8A52E6F6238","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"힘 내!","female":"힘 내!","variant_male_record_index":"69996","variant_female_record_index":"69997","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修士马克西姆":{"text":"수도사 맥심","source":"修士马克西姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count"